    "job_name": "A cold plate of revenge",
    "job_description": "Sifting through the restricted job postings, you find quite the oddity: an offer from the Diable Avionics Corporation. They rarely hire outsiders, and their willingness to make an exception gives you pause. Perhaps they just need someone to take the fall.\n\nThe job description is pretty laconic: the ==Tri-tachyon Corporation== somehow got their hands on a lost odd-ball ship of theirs, and they want it gone. The trick being that the ship is part of a fleet located in the well defended ==$system system==.\n\nThe documentation about the target is thorough, as you can expect from the life-long professionals of DA's intelligence offices, and paints quite an ==impressive ship==. One you probably would not mind keeping if the option presented itself. The information about rest of the fleet are hazier, the target escorts are regularly rotated to prevent exactly what this offer is asking of you.",
    #"job_comm_reply": "",
    "job_intel_success": "You send word of your victory and wait for an answer, somehow unable to shake the feeling that sometime in the near future you will get hit by another bounty hunter hired to eliminate any witness of Diable Avionics' involvment in this battle. No reply come to relieve your angst but you do get a notification that the appropriate sum has been deposited into your account. You will probably have some trouble sleeping the next few nights.",
    #"job_intel_failure": "",
    #"job_intel_expired": "",
    "job_forFaction": "diableavionics",
    "job_deadline": 0,
    "job_credit_reward": 400000,
    "job_reputation_reward":15,
