    "job_name": "Save the Children",
    "job_description": "You notice an open call to action for a charity, a somewhat unusual avenue for those organizations but nothing unheard of.\n\n\"The Diable Avionics Corporation, true to its name, is using child laborers and even child soldiers to fuel its offensive and illegal ambitions over the free citizen of the Sector. None of those precious beings should have ever been sacrificed on the altar of greed and lust for power. This ongoing vile act must stop now!\n\nThe Brighter Future For Everyone association has committed a ==$reward credits reward== for the elimination of the symbol of this oppression: the fleet known as ==The last Line== in the ==$system system==. The flagship of this fleet was developed at the cost of countless innocent lives, such abhorrent creation must be destroyed.\"\n\nThe whole thing goes on a few more paragraphs without adding much substance. Your intelligence officer interrupts your thoughts: this charity is wholly funded and owned by the Tri-Tachyon Corporation, a revelation that does not surprise you in the slightest.",
    "job_intel_success": "The reward comes accompanied by an invitation to a gala as well as a request for an interview. It seems that the backers of the Brighter Future For Everyone charity want to extract the most propaganda and goodwill from your involvement. You direct your comms officer to ignore their requests: the DA's army is not renowned for its forgiveness and this is one feat they are bound to want retribution for. You see no reason to make their task easier by exposing yourself for the gain of others.",
    #"job_intel_failure": "",
    #"job_intel_expired": "",
    "job_forFaction": "tritachyon",
    "job_deadline": 360,
