        "job_name": "Rise Of The Damned",
        "job_description": "Diable intelligence identifies Captain Samuel Rodrigues as a privateer operating under a Navarchy of Tania commission. He lost most of his ships in a recent engagement and is now trying to return to Carina.\n\nRodrigues rebuilt his fleet from a Diable ship graveyard. His crews patched a Pandemonium together from several wrecks and salvaged Drafts, Vapors, and a pair of Fractus carriers. They also coaxed a failing nanoforge back online. Coanda was the only intact hull pattern in its archive, so they kept building Coandas until the forge burned out.\n\nDiable wants Rodrigues eliminated before he reaches friendly space. He commands from the flotilla's ==Pandemonium==.",
